    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore medieval times through the eyes of an independent Tavern Builder, taking up jobs to fix and renovate established taverns. Restock the shelves with beverages, clean the floors, paint the walls and fix the lamps. Earn gold coins, upgrade your tools, become more efficient in your skills and expand your business to get bigger clients. Beware though, alcoholic hooligans often get out of hand in these lawless times and make a lot of mess. Are you up for the challenge to make the Taverns look good and functioning even better?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore medieval times through the eyes of an independent Tavern Builder, taking up jobs to fix and renovate established taverns. Restock the shelves with beverages, clean the floors, paint the walls and fix the lamps. Earn gold coins, upgrade your tools, become more efficient in your skills and expand your business to get bigger clients. Beware though, alcoholic hooligans often get out of hand in these lawless times and make a lot of mess. Are you up for the challenge to make the Taverns look good and functioning even better?</p>",
